    <briefdescription>
<para>Detects whether the IMU is stationary based on sensor readings. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses simple thresholding on gyroscope magnitude and accelerometer deviation from gravity to determine stationarity. This allows covariance estimators to only update during stationary periods, avoiding motion-induced variance inflation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
